graph TB
    %% Architecture Diagram: Highest-Level View
    
    subgraph ClientSpace [1. Client Space / User Device]
        Browser[User Web Browser]
        StripeCheckout[Stripe Payment Form Interface]
    end

    subgraph CloudflareHosting [2. Cloudflare Cloud Infrastructure Edge]
        subgraph StaticCDN [Pages CDN]
            Styles[Tailwind CSS stylesheets]
            Scripts[Compiled JS client code]
        end
        
        subgraph WorkersEngine [Workers serverless Runtime]
            Handler[workers/app.ts Handler]
            ReactRouterSSR[React Router SSR Engine]
            HonoAPI[Hono API Backend Routing]
            
            Handler -->|routes non-API| ReactRouterSSR
            Handler -->|routes /api/*| HonoAPI
        end

        subgraph D1Database [D1 Storage Node]
            SQLite[(D1 SQLite database)]
        end
    end

    subgraph ExternalSaaS [3. Third Party Services]
        StripeServer[Stripe Billing Servers]
        Unsplash[Unsplash Images CDN]
    end

    %% Interaction Paths
    Browser -->|loads layout & bundles| StaticCDN
    Browser -->|interacts| Handler
    ReactRouterSSR -->|fetches dynamic data| SQLite
    HonoAPI -->|reads/writes| SQLite
    
    HonoAPI -->|creates session| StripeServer
    ReactRouterSSR -->|verifies session| StripeServer
    Browser -->|redirect payment flow| StripeCheckout
    StripeCheckout -->|process transaction| StripeServer
    
    Browser -.->|loads asset photos| Unsplash
    SQLite -.->|references photo links| Unsplash
